### This Little Coach API — exemplos (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Requer AUTH_DEV_BYPASS=true (fora de produção). Com Supabase, troca o cabeçalho
### x-dev-user-email por: Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@host = http://localhost:3000
@devUser = ana@example.com
# Preenche estes ids a partir das respostas anteriores
@exerciseId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
@exerciseId2 = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@workoutId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003

### Health (público)
GET {{host}}/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- /me

### Utilizador + perfil (cria o utilizador no primeiro pedido)
GET {{host}}/me
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Atualizar dados do utilizador
PATCH {{host}}/me
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Ana Silva", "locale": "pt-PT", "timezone": "Europe/Lisbon" }

### Atualizar perfil (parcial)
PATCH {{host}}/me/profile
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sex": "FEMALE",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-04",
  "heightCm": 168,
  "startingWeightKg": 72.5,
  "targetWeightKg": 68,
  "restrictedMuscles": ["LOWER_BACK"],
  "limitationsNote": "Evitar flexão lombar com carga"
}

### Concluir onboarding
POST {{host}}/me/onboarding
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "LOSE_FAT",
  "fitnessLevel": "INTERMEDIATE",
  "availableEquipment": ["MAT", "DUMBBELLS"],
  "preferredSessionMinutes": 30,
  "trainingDaysPerWeek": 4,
  "focus": "LOWER_BODY_GLUTES",
  "preferredLocation": "HOME"
}

### Eliminar conta (soft delete) — depois disto, os pedidos respondem 401 ACCOUNT_DELETED
DELETE {{host}}/me
x-dev-user-email: apagar@example.com

### --------------------------------------------------------- /exercises

### Catálogo (localizado), paginado por cursor
GET {{host}}/exercises?limit=20
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Página seguinte
GET {{host}}/exercises?limit=20&cursor={{exerciseId}}
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Só exercícios exequíveis com este equipamento (NONE está sempre incluído)
GET {{host}}/exercises?equipment=MAT,DUMBBELLS&maxDifficulty=3&limit=50
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Pesquisa (nome canónico, slug ou tradução) + filtros
GET {{host}}/exercises?search=agachamento&movementPattern=SQUAT&category=STRENGTH&muscle=GLUTES
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Detalhe (inclui easierIds/harderIds)
GET {{host}}/exercises/{{exerciseId}}
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------- /workouts

### Treinos visíveis: SYSTEM publicados + os meus (mais recentes primeiro)
GET {{host}}/workouts?limit=20
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Filtros
GET {{host}}/workouts?source=SYSTEM&focus=FULL_BODY&maxDurationMin=30
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Treino completo
GET {{host}}/workouts/{{workoutId}}
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Criar treino manualmente (source USER)
POST {{host}}/workouts
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "O meu circuito",
  "description": "Corpo inteiro em casa",
  "focus": "FULL_BODY",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "MAIN",
      "format": "CIRCUIT",
      "rounds": 3,
      "restBetweenExercisesSec": 15,
      "restBetweenRoundsSec": 60,
      "exercises": [
        { "exerciseId": "{{exerciseId}}", "targetReps": 12 },
        { "exerciseId": "{{exerciseId2}}", "targetDurationSec": 40, "restAfterSec": 20 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Gerar o "treino de hoje" (source GENERATED; equipamento por defeito = perfil)
POST {{host}}/workouts/generate
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "availableMinutes": 30, "energyLevel": 4, "equipment": ["MAT", "DUMBBELLS"], "focus": "LOWER_BODY", "seed": 42 }

### Arquivar um treino meu (204). Treinos de outros / SYSTEM -> 404
DELETE {{host}}/workouts/{{workoutId}}
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------- /sessions

### Iniciar sessão a partir de um treino (guarda snapshot)
POST {{host}}/sessions
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "workoutId": "{{workoutId}}", "energyBefore": 4 }

### Iniciar treino livre
POST {{host}}/sessions
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "workoutId": null, "energyBefore": 3, "startedAt": "2026-09-09T08:00:00.000Z" }

### Registar séries (lote; idempotente por id — reenviar atualiza)
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/sets
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sets": [
    {
      "id": "6f1d2c3e-1111-4a2b-9c3d-000000000001",
      "exerciseId": "{{exerciseId}}",
      "blockOrder": 0, "round": 1, "order": 0,
      "targetReps": 12, "repsCompleted": 10, "rpe": 7,
      "adjustmentReason": "TOO_HARD",
      "completedAt": "2026-09-09T08:05:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1d2c3e-1111-4a2b-9c3d-000000000002",
      "exerciseId": "{{exerciseId2}}",
      "blockOrder": 0, "round": 1, "order": 1,
      "targetDurationSec": 40, "durationSec": 40,
      "completedAt": "2026-09-09T08:06:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}

### Concluir (séries pendentes + feedback -> calorias e recordes)
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/complete
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "durationSec": 1500,
  "rpe": 7,
  "moodAfter": 4,
  "rating": 5,
  "notes": "Boa sessão",
  "sets": [
    {
      "id": "6f1d2c3e-1111-4a2b-9c3d-000000000003",
      "exerciseId": "{{exerciseId}}",
      "blockOrder": 0, "round": 2, "order": 0,
      "repsCompleted": 12, "loadKg": 8.5,
      "completedAt": "2026-09-09T08:12:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}

### Abandonar
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/abandon
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Histórico (mais recentes primeiro), com filtros
GET {{host}}/sessions?limit=20&status=COMPLETED&from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-30T23:59:59Z
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Detalhe (snapshot + séries + recordes desta sessão)
GET {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------- /progress

### Resumo (semana atual, sequência, peso, recordes recentes)
GET {{host}}/progress/overview
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Medições dos últimos 90 dias
GET {{host}}/progress/measurements
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### Registar/atualizar a medição de um dia (upsert por utilizador + data + MANUAL)
PUT {{host}}/progress/measurements
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "measuredAt": "2026-09-09", "weightKg": 71.8, "bodyFatPct": 24.5, "waistCm": 80, "notes": "em jejum" }

### Recordes pessoais
GET {{host}}/progress/records
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}

### ------------------------------------------------------ erros esperados

### Sem autenticação -> 401 MISSING_TOKEN
GET {{host}}/me

### Corpo inválido -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR com details[]
POST {{host}}/workouts/generate
x-dev-user-email: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "availableMinutes": 5, "energyLevel": 9 }

### Recurso de outro utilizador -> 404
GET {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
x-dev-user-email: outra@example.com
